#: ../../../full_host_build.md:94
msgid "Building a Simple Sysroot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../full_host_build.md:97
msgid ""
"The LLVM libc is missing many critical functions needed to build non-trivial "
"applications. If you are not currently working on porting the libc, we "
"recommend sticking with your system libc. However, ignoring warnings like "
"this are how most of us got into this business. So: Speak friend and enter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../full_host_build.md:102
msgid ""
"This document describes how to set up a simple sysroot and a compiler that "
"uses it from scratch. These are not full cross-compilation instructions. We "
"make a few assumptions:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../full_host_build.md:106
msgid ""
"The host and target are the same architecture and OS. For example, building "
"a Linux x86-64 libc on a Linux x86-64 host."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../full_host_build.md:108
msgid ""
"The host has a working and recent Clang toolchain. Clang 21 has been tested."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../full_host_build.md:109
msgid ""
"Your container is using Debian Testing or a derived distribution. Other "
"distributions likely work but the package names and paths may differ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../full_host_build.md:111
msgid "You have root access to your machine to set up the compiler wrapper."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../full_host_build.md:113
msgid ""
"For more comprehensive instructions on setting up a sysroot, see the "
"[official LLVM guide](https://llvm.org/docs/HowToCrossCompileLLVM."
"html#setting-up-a-sysroot)."
msgstr ""

