msgid ""
"Next, install the Linux kernel headers into your sysroot. For this guide, "
"we'll copy the headers from the host system's `/usr/include` directory. This "
"includes `linux`, `asm-generic`, and the architecture-specific `asm` headers."
msgstr ""

